WEBVTT

00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:36.860
Beneath the roots and fallen leaves

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:40.860
Beyond the world our eyes can see

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:45.950
A silent web has always grown

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:48.600
A hidden life beneath our own

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:52.600
No voice, no words, no beating heart

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:56.600
Yet every thread becomes a part

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:01.790
Of something ancient, vast and deep

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:05.920
Awake below while we still sleep

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:12.060
For centuries we walked above

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:16.060
Unaware of what connects us

00:01:18.430 --> 00:01:22.430
Listen to the forest

00:01:22.650 --> 00:01:26.650
Listen to the ground

00:01:27.470 --> 00:01:31.210
The oldest living network

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:35.210
Has always been around

00:01:35.810 --> 00:01:39.810
A million unseen pathways

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:43.990
A language yet unknown

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:47.790
We are only learning

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:51.790
How to hear its tone

00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:14.600
Through storm and fire, drought and rain

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:18.600
The network learns, adapts, sustains

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:22.740
It feeds the weak, it shares the light

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:26.690
It keeps the balance out of sight

00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:30.690
No king, no center, no command

00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:34.970
Yet forests rise from thread and strand

00:02:35.440 --> 00:02:39.440
A living map beneath our feet

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:43.250
Where countless lives and signals meet

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:45.220
Not to conquer

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:47.340
Not to own

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:51.340
But to understand

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:54.330
Listen to the forest

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:58.330
Listen to the ground

00:02:58.330 --> 00:03:02.330
The oldest living network

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:06.330
Has always been around

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:10.330
A million unseen pathways

00:03:12.140 --> 00:03:15.720
A language yet unknown

00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:19.720
We are only learning

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:23.920
How to hear its tone

00:03:42.810 --> 00:03:46.770
Science lights the pathway

00:03:46.770 --> 00:03:50.770
Wonder starts the flame

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:54.750
Questions lead us forward

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:58.750
Before we know the name

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:03.750
Every signal matters

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:08.030
Every voice may grow

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:10.360
The future starts with listening

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:14.360
To what we do not know

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:18.580
Listen to the forest

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:25.330
Listen to the trees

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:29.230
Listen to the hidden world

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:33.020
Beneath the roots we see

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:37.020
A million unseen pathways

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:41.370
Connected all as one

00:04:41.370 --> 00:04:43.370
And we have just begun

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:47.370
We have just begun

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:02.930
Beneath our feet

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:06.100
The network waits

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:10.100
And we have just begun

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:19.920
To listen
